OL,5,G1745 Agatha Christie's Poirot
OL,6,     FAt a flower show, an older woman
OL,7,     Fin a wheelchair approaches Poirot,
OL,8,     Fgives him an empty seed packet,
OL,9,     Fand asks him to visit her. The
OL,10,     Fnext day, the woman is dead,
OL,11,     Fmurdered with poison
OL,12,G1850 Agatha Christie's Poirot
OL,13,     FHercule Poirot, a famous Belgian
OL,14,     Fdetective, who has an impeccable
OL,15,     Fknack for getting embroiled in a
OL,16,     Fmystery, solves crimes along with
OL,17,     FCaptain Hastings and Chief
OL,18,     FInspector James Japp
