OL,5,G2300 Coronation Street 60 Unforgettable
OL,6,G     Years
OL,7,     FOn 9th December 1960, the first
OL,8,     Fepisode of a new serial drama was
OL,9,     Fbroadcast on ITV. Coronation
OL,10,     FStreet would go on to become the
OL,11,     Flongest-running soap opera in the
OL,12,     Fworld.
OL,13,G0030 Victoria
